5. ACK only after durable processing
6. Retry with exponential backoff + jitter
7. DLQ for poison messages
8. Provider idempotency
9. Transactional outbox where DB → broker consistency matters
10. Reconciliation for uncertain external outcomes
That is a solid senior-level foundation.
