17. Rebalance isn't free
During certain forms of rebalancing, consumers may temporarily stop normal partition processing while ownership is redistributed.
Conceptually:
Normal processing
       ↓
REBALANCE
       ↓
partition assignment
       ↓
Normal processing
If your system rebalances constantly:
process
rebalance
process
rebalance
process
rebalance
throughput can collapse.
This is a real production problem.
