39. A reliable basic consumer
For a simple sequential consumer, a strong starting model is:
consumer.subscribe(List.of("orders"));

while (running) {

    ConsumerRecords<String, Order> records =
            consumer.poll(Duration.ofMillis(1000));

    for (ConsumerRecord<String, Order> record : records) {
        process(record);
    }

    consumer.commitSync();
}
The important semantic ordering is:
poll
 ↓
business processing
 ↓
commit
not the exact code itself.
