41. Step 2 — Partition sizing
You need enough partitions for:
producer parallelism
consumer parallelism
broker distribution
Suppose your benchmark demonstrates:
one partition ≈ 50 MB/sec
as a hypothetical benchmark result.
At peak:
2 GB/sec
you'd need at least:
