43. Step 4 — Availability zones
A reasonable topology:
            Kafka Cluster

      AZ-A       AZ-B       AZ-C

       B1         B2         B3
       B4         B5         B6
       │          │          │
       └──── replicated ─────┘
You distribute replicas across AZs.
Then an AZ failure doesn't automatically destroy all replicas of a partition.
