42. The answer I'd expect from a strong system-design candidate
Conceptually:
                         payment.q
                             |
                             v
                     Payment Consumer
                             |
                ┌────────────┼─────────────┐
                |            |             |
             success      transient      permanent
                |            |             |
               ACK           |            DLQ
                             |
                       retry + backoff
                             |
                    ┌────────┼────────┐
                    v        v        v
                   10s      1m        5m
                    |        |        |
                    └────────┴────────┘
                             |
                             v
