This is much cleaner than making every producer know about Analytics.
________________________________________
33. Producer decoupling
Notice what happened.
Order Service publishes:
order.created
It doesn't need to know:
Payment exists
Inventory exists
Notification exists
Analytics exists
It simply publishes the event.
The routing topology determines consumers.
That's a major benefit of messaging.
Producer
   |
   v
Exchange
   |
   +---- Consumer A
   +---- Consumer B
   +---- Consumer C
Producer and consumers are decoupled.
